        },
        "rw" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Igura ryabanje rya US$%lld ryari ritegereje gukoreshwa, bityo iryo ni ryo ryarangijwe aho kongera kukwishyuza. Garuka kuri Safari ufungure idirishya rirambuka rya DisinfaX kugira ngo urebe konti yawe yavuguruwe."
